[{"key":"0946kxw1w3kugc","text":"Sneaky pawn trick! A pawn that jumps two steps past yours can be caught, as if it moved only one."},{"key":"03l96sm0bzjl32","text":"En passant: capture a pawn that just moved two squares, as if it moved one."},{"key":"1co27i71j5jbwr","text":"Two rooks climb the ladder! Push the king to the edge and checkmate."},{"key":"1tsm1lm0meyn9m","text":"A fork attacks two pieces at once. The knight is the best at forks!"},{"key":"1e4unld0r0fiqn","text":"The knight attacks the king. That's check! He can still get away."},{"key":"0lz619t186qy9h","text":"The rook attacks the king. That's check! He can still get away."},{"key":"0mgdefb0mam30l","text":"The rooks alternate: one cuts off a rank, the other checks."},{"key":"06q4y141fps7d4","text":"The rook attacks the king and he can't escape. Checkmate!"},{"key":"1oy7ybt0b9n3yp","text":"Every move must eat a snack! Eat them all with the king."},{"key":"0cfc99418dgtoa","text":"Shelly found this checkmate. Let's remember that trick!"},{"key":"1afzn3g1tcae94","text":"Olive found this checkmate. Let's remember that trick!"},{"key":"1u2jmc81968dkw","text":"Tuck found this checkmate. Let's remember that trick!"},{"key":"06bkv4j0pb08o7","text":"Careful! The king could gobble your pawn. Try again!"},{"key":"1iq30sl0un1d1r","text":"Stalemate: no legal moves and not in check. A draw."},{"key":"04g7v18086tj8w","text":"Oops, Shelly left a knight alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"0n16wmq0tbd2ym","text":"Oops, Olive left a knight alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1omolsm1ch4hws","text":"Count what you win, then what they can take back."},{"key":"0wi1z4n0pjqrep","text":"Oops, Shelly left a pawn alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"04owhfj1w248zb","text":"Oops, Olive left a queen alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"12m8e4d0d4si39","text":"What does the knight want? Keep your queen safe!"},{"key":"1ew7g4k1pvbyo2","text":"Oops, Olive left a king alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1gxslfi09ai9w6","text":"Oops, Bruno left a pawn alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"0m34hqy00pq6wy","text":"No legal moves and no check: stalemate, a draw."},{"key":"19ws2a411ff182","text":"What does the rook want? Keep your knight safe!"},{"key":"0sfcux00hzxmh8","text":"Oops, Tuck left a rook alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"0rby2fb0hqaarl","text":"Attack the big piece. The one behind it falls!"},{"key":"0tp1b7e1p1zr6c","text":"Your turn! Tap every square the queen can go."},{"key":"0i5hvoe1mzcefw","text":"Oops, Hop left a rook alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1aqsa8f05xblpx","text":"Oh no, no snacks left to reach! Press Reset."},{"key":"02zyq1i0ne5x98","text":"Find a move that attacks two things at once!"},{"key":"13915te1vcby6o","text":"Stalemate! Nobody can move, so it's a tie."},{"key":"0yexdy41u0spmu","text":"Bruno's mating move. Remember the pattern."},{"key":"0j7bz9p1g8rk03","text":"What color is the bishop on? And the star?"},{"key":"18ckito1a6l2us","text":"Tuck is napping, Olive will play instead."},{"key":"0blfde509nylsb","text":"Fern's mating move. Remember the pattern."},{"key":"19432170bg4qsh","text":"Your family filled the star jar together!"},{"key":"06k5y0206bydvu","text":"Yes! That bishop is attacking the king!"},{"key":"0v69zw90ip07sn","text":"Check, checkmate, stalemate or nothing?"},{"key":"0zud2cz07qgb5x","text":"First the letter a, then the number 3."},{"key":"186vq9o07qgbai","text":"First the letter a, then the number 8."},{"key":"04cwipw0u81nig","text":"First the letter b, then the number 5."},{"key":"1d48za01gpmzqe","text":"First the letter c, then the number 2."},{"key":"1doq5rl1gpmzuz","text":"First the letter c, then the number 7."},{"key":"0imljdj0464a3t","text":"First the letter d, then the number 4."},{"key":"036ywmt0qnpmbr","text":"First the letter e, then the number 1."},{"key":"0ta0pc60qnpmgc","text":"First the letter e, then the number 6."},{"key":"1gqyx6m1d5ayoa","text":"First the letter f, then the number 3."},{"key":"0hrx8a91d5aysv","text":"First the letter f, then the number 8."},{"key":"0kacvtb00ls91p","text":"First the letter g, then the number 5."},{"key":"1651eat0n3dl9n","text":"First the letter h, then the number 2."},{"key":"062sq840n3dle8","text":"First the letter h, then the number 7."},{"key":"0akfjvo1t34344","text":"Light squares are pale, like the sun!"},{"key":"0j4lmrk1jr726a","text":"Shelly made a queen first. Try again!"},{"key":"1gdf8ea19zuhjc","text":"You win 14, and nobody can take back!"},{"key":"1fdp3un1bk3nzv","text":"Yes! That pawn is attacking the king!"},{"key":"1usgjxl125scd3","text":"Bruno made a queen first. Try again!"},{"key":"0rixv2e0j7hgs6","text":"You win 3, and nobody can take back!"},{"key":"08ast451mcd1y3","text":"You win 8, and nobody can take back!"},{"key":"089i0r90c0p3lt","text":"Hop to attack the king AND the rook!"},{"key":"1e7mz5x1ekauzl","text":"That one is light. Find a dark one!"},{"key":"1lb2z5o0w64tnm","text":"The king has a little cross on top."},{"key":"0uwhwn40wyh494","text":"Tuck made a queen first. Try again!"},{"key":"0is56vk0olfhsq","text":"Warm-up complete. On to new things."},{"key":"0vx9ar9109ka5j","text":"Ding ding! Your king is in danger!"},{"key":"0ip2gy008b4f44","text":"The bishop can't reach the cookie."},{"key":"0c0w80h1f0dyrr","text":"That PIN did not match. Try again."},{"key":"151leia0nrr09u","text":"That's the rook! Find the bishop."},{"key":"060d12g0xd7x8w","text":"That's the knight! Find the king."},{"key":"0m0qml10h1gzz7","text":"Good thinking! Find a safer move."},{"key":"1sb5i9v0dt5ff3","text":"Look for a piece on a new square."},{"key":"0ppygqf1ydag0v","text":"Light squares are the pale ones."},{"key":"0l64y9l0dkn5c9","text":"That's the queen! Find the king."},{"key":"1qwe8p7096joib","text":"The outlines show where they go."},{"key":"1jn4ats1jso9ru","text":"Check with no escape: checkmate."},{"key":"15ek7xx1uzdi97","text":"Three perfect. Try a harder one?"},{"key":"09szhw91duq9pv","text":"That's the pawn! Find the rook."},{"key":"0eva2a800yrftk","text":"Capture